{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A grisly murder took place at the offices of Lilien Entertainment, home of famous VTuber &quot;Kuripa,&quot; resulting in the death of its founder. The killer can only be one of the company's six employees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's weird, though, is that multiple employees all claim to be Kuripa's real face, saying they were streaming at the time of the murder\u2014which is, of course, impossible. As prosecutor Justin Truth, it's your job to get to the bottom of this mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/f39d3e2ace8ef549828d4c21343e62a8.avif?t=1773128671\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Hardboiled Detective Comedy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a serious detective game, but that doesn't mean it takes itself too seriously. Each suspect has their own colorful personality, and may occasionally get a little ridiculous. But don't let their humor catch you off guard\u2014these are suspects, after all, so anyone could be lying right to your face!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/f02db3714e7ac927ca370519c9bc7118.poster.avif?t=1773128671\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/f02db3714e7ac927ca370519c9bc7118.webm?t=1773128671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/f02db3714e7ac927ca370519c9bc7118.mp4?t=1773128671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hunt for Leads Online</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also hop on the internet to search for clues when necessary. If you're a VTuber fan, you can even hunt for Easter eggs on Kuripa's very own channel. We made a full-fledged social media investigation system, and there's a CAT... which should be enough for you to wishlist this game right now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/cf10bebe0258f5cc28f74f127aa310d7.poster.avif?t=1773128671\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/cf10bebe0258f5cc28f74f127aa310d7.webm?t=1773128671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/cf10bebe0258f5cc28f74f127aa310d7.mp4?t=1773128671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Court without the Boring Parts!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our courtroom segments rely solely on questioning witnesses and presenting evidence! It's court without any of the boring slow parts!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Friendly Witnesses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll be working together with your witnesses, guiding them to provide testimonies that will help your case. Make sure you follow the rules, though, or the defense attorney will object and stop you in your tracks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/9da398f89487bb7348ff6dd28d448ad3.poster.avif?t=1773128671\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/9da398f89487bb7348ff6dd28d448ad3.webm?t=1773128671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/9da398f89487bb7348ff6dd28d448ad3.mp4?t=1773128671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hostile Witnesses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the defense attorney questions her witnesses, it's your turn to poke holes in their testimonies. The second they say something &quot;objectionable,&quot; well... you get to say the magic word!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/f8201c9a7d2800183336d6110337439c.poster.avif?t=1773128671\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/f8201c9a7d2800183336d6110337439c.webm?t=1773128671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/f8201c9a7d2800183336d6110337439c.mp4?t=1773128671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cross-examinations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the defense attorney is done, you can cross-examine her witness. If they say anything that conflicts with evidence you have on hand, don't be shy! Present that evidence and show them who's boss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/37d4eb59dbbbf0dd51de53528e34f058.poster.avif?t=1773128671\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/37d4eb59dbbbf0dd51de53528e34f058.webm?t=1773128671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/37d4eb59dbbbf0dd51de53528e34f058.mp4?t=1773128671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Who's the Killer!?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember your goal\u2014this whole game is about finding the killer. It's up to you to choose who you think it is, a decision that will directly influence the game's ending. There's only one true killer, of course, which means there's a very real chance of you choosing the wrong one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/561db106450c3818c47a7d4e7151ce05.poster.avif?t=1773128671\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/561db106450c3818c47a7d4e7151ce05.webm?t=1773128671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/561db106450c3818c47a7d4e7151ce05.mp4?t=1773128671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Livestreaming Restrictions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some portions of our game cannot be streamed. Please check our streaming rules in the Community Hub.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Special Note</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even though this game is about uncovering a VTuber's real face, we don't actually condone doing that in real life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No VTubers were harmed in the making of this game, except for the one in this game.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Beginning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2871140/88a0cf35878b1fa85750ca9f2153fd8f384bc674.jpg"},{"name":"The Basics","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2871140/5c9f283fe789186bbfc3cc5cb800f633123173ba.jpg"},{"name":"Objection!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2871140/384169a4d55b40bc16b08ebd7e53dd5b5a21d646.jpg"},{"name":"Diversion!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2871140/95ced22865e4f4ce798845a8f60069594da0192b.jpg"},{"name":"Important Announcement!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2871140/e50a204cb14a97a6d6fbb3de11254e96798ed460.jpg"},{"name":"Mommy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2871140/7d6da8301a2543239cfa0140b1e814fcd8dc5866.jpg"},{"name":"Agent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2871140/69d54b4d9a1f4e1b76b1c5021bfc2d010efbb387.jpg"},{"name":"Daddy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2871140/b733e46989eef6d0ef538219f43970bb23f05cff.jpg"},{"name":"Hide and Seek","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2871140/76730eac352f6b285cc892f2d1f9582d9c43706c.jpg"},{"name":"Doubt","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2871140/e359bdf7de522e74b0a3377841cd47246fd6a25c.jpg"}],"total":18},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2871140?t=1773128671","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/4c3481a3a0ce9ff92609b0e8d50a44f4b418b3fa/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773128671","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/34f8189fdbe072b378178389a7bd0d1129385068/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773128671","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/34f8189fdbe072b378178389a7bd0d1129385068/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773128671","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The work depicts crime, corpses, or death; certain scenes contain bloody imagery or suggest acts of self-harm."},"demos":[{"appid":3039450,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A grisly murder took place at the offices of Lilien Entertainment, home of famous VTuber &quot;Kuripa,&quot; resulting in the death of its founder. The killer can only be one of the company's six employees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's weird, though, is that multiple employees all claim to be Kuripa's real face, saying they were streaming at the time of the murder\u2014which is, of course, impossible. As prosecutor Justin Truth, it's your job to get to the bottom of this mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/f39d3e2ace8ef549828d4c21343e62a8.avif?t=1773128671\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Hardboiled Detective Comedy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a serious detective game, but that doesn't mean it takes itself too seriously. Each suspect has their own colorful personality, and may occasionally get a little ridiculous. But don't let their humor catch you off guard\u2014these are suspects, after all, so anyone could be lying right to your face!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/f02db3714e7ac927ca370519c9bc7118.poster.avif?t=1773128671\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/f02db3714e7ac927ca370519c9bc7118.webm?t=1773128671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/f02db3714e7ac927ca370519c9bc7118.mp4?t=1773128671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hunt for Leads Online</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also hop on the internet to search for clues when necessary. If you're a VTuber fan, you can even hunt for Easter eggs on Kuripa's very own channel. We made a full-fledged social media investigation system, and there's a CAT... which should be enough for you to wishlist this game right now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/cf10bebe0258f5cc28f74f127aa310d7.poster.avif?t=1773128671\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/cf10bebe0258f5cc28f74f127aa310d7.webm?t=1773128671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/cf10bebe0258f5cc28f74f127aa310d7.mp4?t=1773128671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Court without the Boring Parts!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our courtroom segments rely solely on questioning witnesses and presenting evidence! It's court without any of the boring slow parts!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Friendly Witnesses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll be working together with your witnesses, guiding them to provide testimonies that will help your case. Make sure you follow the rules, though, or the defense attorney will object and stop you in your tracks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/9da398f89487bb7348ff6dd28d448ad3.poster.avif?t=1773128671\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/9da398f89487bb7348ff6dd28d448ad3.webm?t=1773128671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/9da398f89487bb7348ff6dd28d448ad3.mp4?t=1773128671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hostile Witnesses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the defense attorney questions her witnesses, it's your turn to poke holes in their testimonies. The second they say something &quot;objectionable,&quot; well... you get to say the magic word!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/f8201c9a7d2800183336d6110337439c.poster.avif?t=1773128671\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/f8201c9a7d2800183336d6110337439c.webm?t=1773128671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/f8201c9a7d2800183336d6110337439c.mp4?t=1773128671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cross-examinations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the defense attorney is done, you can cross-examine her witness. If they say anything that conflicts with evidence you have on hand, don't be shy! Present that evidence and show them who's boss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/37d4eb59dbbbf0dd51de53528e34f058.poster.avif?t=1773128671\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/37d4eb59dbbbf0dd51de53528e34f058.webm?t=1773128671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/37d4eb59dbbbf0dd51de53528e34f058.mp4?t=1773128671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Who's the Killer!?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember your goal\u2014this whole game is about finding the killer. It's up to you to choose who you think it is, a decision that will directly influence the game's ending. There's only one true killer, of course, which means there's a very real chance of you choosing the wrong one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/561db106450c3818c47a7d4e7151ce05.poster.avif?t=1773128671\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/561db106450c3818c47a7d4e7151ce05.webm?t=1773128671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871140/extras/561db106450c3818c47a7d4e7151ce05.mp4?t=1773128671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Livestreaming Restrictions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some portions of our game cannot be streamed. Please check our streaming rules in the Community Hub.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Special Note</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even though this game is about uncovering a VTuber's real face, we don't actually condone doing that in real life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No VTubers were harmed in the making of this game, except for the one in this game.</p>","developers":["\u8389\u8389\u6069\u5de5\u4f5c\u5ba4"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"